@BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/authentication

### Register
POST {{BASE_URL}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Thai",
  "lastName": "Thai",
  "email": "phamdinhthai123@example.com",
  "password": "phamdinhthai123"
}

### Login
POST {{BASE_URL}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "phamdinhthai123@example.com",
  "password": "phamdinhthai123"
}

### Refresh
POST {{BASE_URL}}/refresh